  "meta": {
    "description": "Builds the SIP REFER target with the return UUI (version, correlationId, sessionId, intent, handoffReason, language, caseId when it fits) and marks the session HANDOFF. Inputs: sessionId, intent, handoffReason, summary. Returns {ok, referTo, uuiHex, uuiAscii, uuiPayload, truncated}. Deterministic; called by AR-01 and AR-02, never by the model."
